# Agent-conducted arrangement — numeric steering (the stream an agent sends via
# pulp_inspect_set_param). Frame = 1920 samples @ 48kHz (40 ms).
0  prompt warm analog pads with sub bass
0  temperature 1.0
0  cfg_musiccoca 1.5
0  top_k 40
# build energy: raise temperature + prompt CFG
15 temperature 1.4
15 cfg_musiccoca 2.5
# peak: hotter, narrower sampling
30 temperature 1.7
30 top_k 24
